    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secrets\" title=\"Force Secrets\">Force Secrets</a></i> </p><p>When you use a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> that has a Cone, line, or radius effect that originates from your square, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> originate from a square within 6 squares of you. Alternatively, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Destiny_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Point\">Destiny Point</a> to have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> originate from any square within your line of sight. You still choose the direction of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> as though you were standing in the chosen square. </p>",
